Title: [issue] onViewableItemsChanged not firing with/after new data appended to start
Description: I have a header component that displays accurate data related to the current most prominent item in view.

It seems like onViewableItemsChanged is not firing when new data is appended at the beginning of the list. Basically it goes to index 0 and then is not firing anymore.

For your idea my implementation:

```typescript
